  "notes": "This batch replaces the unused broad nhdplus_crosswalk_official placeholder fixture with a bounded waterbody-only crosswalk family. It validates exact, split, merge, and complex mapping cardinality; uses ANSWER only for one-to-one lookup and ABSTAIN for every multi-match row; rejects duplicate pairs, impossible overlap area, false geometry equality, flowline-scope drift, and mismatched canonical hashes; and wires the feature into the existing Hydrology workflow. It does not fetch or copy USGS source rows, admit or activate a source, establish flowline/reach/HUC/catchment identity, resolve evidence, apply release policy, validate scientific equivalence, build proof, promote, release, deploy, or publish. Rollback is a clean revert of the feature commit, which restores the removed placeholder and removes the additive bounded family."
